msgstr "検索中... "

#, c-format
msgid "%  (Esc stops)"
msgstr "%  (Escで中止)"

msgid "  read error"
msgstr "  読み込みエラー"

msgid ""
"A reader for Markdown and text: manuals, notes, books.\n"
"\n"
"Space, PgDn\tNext page (Shift+Space back)\n"
"Arrows\tA line\n"
"Home, End\tStart, end (Esc stops a long find)\n"
"Tab\tNext link; Enter follows it\n"
"Backspace\tBack\n"
"Ctrl+O\tOpen\n"
"Ctrl+C\tCopy the selection (drag to select)\n"
"\n"
"A .docx, .odt, .rtf or .epub is converted to read."
msgstr ""
"Markdownとテキストのリーダー: マニュアル、メモ、本。\n"
"\n"
"Space, PgDn\t次のページ (Shift+Spaceで戻る)\n"
"矢印\t1行\n"
"Home, End\t先頭、末尾 (Escで長い検索を中止)\n"
"Tab\t次のリンク; Enterでたどる\n"
"Backspace\t戻る\n"
"Ctrl+O\t開く\n"
"Ctrl+C\t選択範囲をコピー (ドラッグで選択)\n"
"\n"
".docx、.odt、.rtf、.epubは変換して読みます。"

msgid "Read help"
msgstr "readのヘルプ"
